      "solution": "Shortcut: P(at least one 6) = 1 − P(no 6) = 1 − (5/6)³ = 1 − 125/216 = 91/216. Full: Probability of no six in one roll = 5/6; for three independent rolls = (5/6)³ = 125/216; complement gives 91/216.",
