          "text": "6",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "solution": "Shortcut: f'(x)=3x^2-6x=3x(x-2). Critical points x=0,2. Evaluate f(0)=4, f(2)=0, f(3)=4 ⇒ maximum = 4. Full: Check endpoints and critical points; f(0)=4, f(2)=8-12+4=0, f(3)=27-27+4=4. Hence max value is 4.",
